    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm working on this short memo for a policy group about why the current antitrust focus on big tech is actually kind of counterproductive. basically, the idea is that breaking them up would just kill the innovation and the seamless user experience everyone likes. can u help me draft a few points that explain why aggressive regulation is a threat to technological progress?",
